      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "4. 用符号“$\\subset$”“$=$”或“$\\supset$”连接集合 $A$ 与 $B$：",
            "(1) $A=\\{x \\mid x^{2}-2 x+1=0\\}$，$B=\\{x \\mid x^{2}-1=0\\}$；",
            "(2) $A=\\{1,2,4,8\\}$，$B=\\{x \\mid x$ 是 $8$ 的正约数$\\}.$"
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p19_b3",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "exercise",
      "bbox": [
        145,
        230,
        920,
        275
      ],
      "anchor_id": null,
      "figure_group_id": null,
      "content": {
        "text": {
          "paragraphs": [
            "5. 已知集合 $A=\\{1\\}$，$B=\\{x \\mid x^{2}-3 x+a=0\\}$. 是否存在实数 $a$，使得 $A \\subset B$？若存在，求 $a$ 的值；若不存在，说明理由."
          ]
        },
        "table": null,
        "equation": null,
        "figure": null
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "p19_b4",
      "kind": "text",
      "zone": "main",
      "role": "exercise",
      "bbox": [
